x the cut-over weekend and I see three options: 16 Jan, 30 Jan or 13 Feb 2027.

The plan has four phases: data migration, training, dress rehearsal and the c=
ut-over weekend itself. Each option shifts all four. My gut feeling is that J=
anuary is tight because of peak season, but I want your view on the outbound =
volumes before I put a recommendation together.

I would like to decide in a workshop on 5 Nov at 09:00. Jeroen, can you tell =
me which weeks are critical for Venlo outbound? Mark, you are in copy so you =
